% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 7.

the actions are:
    the move mark with *an index*, *a second index* and *a third index* is made; known as mark.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a filler*; known as cell.
    control *a thing*; known as control.
    *a thing* is the col of *an index*; known as col.
    the move mark with *an index*, *a second index* and *a third index* is legal; known as legal_mark.
    open; known as open.
    *a thing* is the row of *an index*; known as row.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    playable; known as playable.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *an index* is a filler.
    *an index* is an index.

the knowledge base sukoshi includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/sukoshi.hrf".

an index is a filler if
    the index is an index.

b is a filler.

1 is an index.

2 is an index.

3 is an index.

the move mark with an index, a second index and a third index is legal at a time if
    the index cell the second index with b at the time
    and the third index is an index
    and it is not the case that the index is the row of the third index at the time
    and it is not the case that the second index is the col of the third index at the time.

a thing is the row of an index at a time if
    the thing cell 1 with the index at the time.

a thing is the row of an index at a time if
    the thing cell 2 with the index at the time.

a thing is the row of an index at a time if
    the thing cell 3 with the index at the time.

a thing is the col of an index at a time if
    1 cell the thing with the index at the time.

a thing is the col of an index at a time if
    2 cell the thing with the index at the time.

a thing is the col of an index at a time if
    3 cell the thing with the index at the time.

the goal of robot is 100 at a time if
    it is not the case that open at the time.

open at a time if
    an index cell a second index with b at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that playable at the time.

playable at a time if
    the move mark with an index, a second index and a third index is legal at the time.

when the move mark with an index, a second index and a third index is made
then the index cell the second index with the third index
    and it is not the case that the index cell the second index with b.

it must not be true that
    the move mark with an index, a second index and a third index is made
    and it is not the case that the move mark with the index, the second index and the third index is legal.

initially 1 cell 1 with b
    and 1 cell 2 with 1
    and 1 cell 3 with b
    and 2 cell 1 with 2
    and 2 cell 2 with b
    and 2 cell 3 with b
    and 3 cell 1 with b
    and 3 cell 2 with b
    and 3 cell 3 with b
    and control robot.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(robot)
%   - cell(1,1,3)
%   - cell(1,2,1)
%   - cell(1,3,2)
%   - cell(2,1,2)
%   - cell(2,2,b)
%   - cell(2,3,3)
%   - cell(3,1,b)
%   - cell(3,2,3)
%   - cell(3,3,1)
scenario play is:
    the move mark with 1, 1 and 3 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move mark with 3, 3 and 1 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move mark with 3, 2 and 3 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move mark with 2, 3 and 3 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move mark with 1, 3 and 2 is made from 5 to 6.

